  "GENERATED FROM VALIDATED RESEARCH DATA": "根据已验证的研究数据…15420 tokens truncated…这并不代表某个具体桌面或编程客户端的完整配置和授权流程已经通过认证。客户端支持时，可使用 OAuth 直接连接托管服务。",
  "The proxy validates key shape locally; Tidelight validates the live key and its current scopes remotely.": "代理程序会在本地检查密钥格式；Tidelight 服务端会验证密钥是否有效及其当前权限范围。",
  "This package is not a standalone replacement for": "此软件包不是以下服务的独立替代品：",
  "The bridge reads": "桥接程序会读取",
  "API keys must be passed through the local process environment or a protected client secret store.": "必须通过本地进程环境变量或受保护的客户端密钥存储提供 API 密钥。",
  "Connection errors are summarized without returning the upstream response body or credential.": "连接错误会以摘要形式显示，不会返回上游响应正文或凭证。",
  "Credentials and authority stay separated.": "凭证与权限控制彼此分离。",
  "Keep the project key in your MCP client’s protected environment.": "请将项目密钥保存在 MCP 客户端的受保护环境中。",
  "The client configuration above uses the canonical source build and keeps credentials in the client’s protected environment.": "上方客户端配置使用规范源代码构建，并将凭证保存在客户端的受保护环境中。",
  "A small Python client for supported Tidelight API v1 market, asynchronous research, and webhook workflows. Keep project credentials on trusted servers and work with typed response objects.": "轻量 Python 客户端，支持 Tidelight API v1 的行情、异步研究和 Webhook 工作流。请将项目凭证保存在可信服务器端，并使用带类型的响应对象。",
  "Install from PyPI or build from source.": "从 PyPI 安装或从源代码构建。",
  "Install the published distribution with": "使用以下命令安装已发布的软件包：",
  "The source setup below installs from the Tidelight repository; the market and research examples use the current client methods.": "下方步骤将从 Tidelight 代码库安装源代码；行情和研究示例使用当前客户端方法。",
  "Python access to the supported API surface.": "通过 Python 访问受支持的 API 功能。",
  "Python examples": "Python 示例",
  "Python versions declared": "声明支持的 Python 版本",
  "Python CI tested": "CI 测试的 Python 版本",
  "Distribution name": "发行包名称",
  "Credential from environment": "从环境变量读取凭证",
  "Typed results · bounded retries": "类型化结果 · 有界重试",
  "Server-side use with bounded transport.": "用于服务器端，并限制传输行为。",
  "The project declares Python": "项目声明支持 Python",
  "; CI currently exercises Python 3.10 and 3.12. No public compatibility or support window has been announced.": "；当前 CI 使用 Python 3.10 和 3.12 进行测试。尚未公布正式的兼容性或支持期限。",
  "; redirects are not followed. HTTP is allowed only for local development hosts.": "；不会跟随重定向。仅允许本地开发主机使用 HTTP。",
  "; signing secrets are returned once.": "；签名密钥仅返回一次。",
  "; there is no fallback source. Project scopes, tenant ownership, and quotas remain authoritative at the API boundary.": "；不会改用其他数据源。API 边界仍以项目权限范围、租户所有权和配额规则为准。",
  "Keys are caller-supplied and kept in process memory; the SDK does not persist credentials.": "密钥由调用方提供并仅保留在进程内存中；SDK 不会持久化凭证。",
  "Network errors, 429, and transient 5xx responses receive at most two retries by default, except": "网络错误、429 和暂时性 5xx 响应默认最多重试两次，但以下情况会立即返回：",
  "Returns paginated typed instrument results with source and underlying mapping; requires": "返回分页的类型化交易工具结果，并包含来源及底层股票映射；需要",
  "Creates a research job with a caller-provided idempotency key; requires": "使用调用方提供的幂等键创建研究任务；需要",
  "Manages supported research event subscriptions with": "使用以下权限管理受支持的研究事件订阅：",
  "start_company_research(ticker, key)": "start_company_research(ticker, key)",
  "Provider redistribution terms are not confirmed. Market calls may return": "数据提供方的再分发条款尚未确认。行情请求可能返回",
  "Webhook mutations are not retried without server idempotency support; signing secrets must be stored securely by the caller.": "服务端不支持幂等操作前，Webhook 变更不会重试；调用方必须安全保存签名密钥。",
  "The client source lives at": "客户端源代码位于",
  "For the exact request and response schema, see the": "请求与响应的准确结构请参阅",
  "React interfaces on top of real Tidelight contracts.": "基于 Tidelight 实际契约构建的 React 界面。",
  "Typed hooks and accessible components for market and research experiences. Connect your UI to an authenticated application backend while keeping Tidelight credentials server-side.": "用于行情与研究场景的类型化 Hook 和易访问组件。将界面连接到经过身份验证的应用后端，同时将 Tidelight 凭证保留在服务器端。",
  "Explore the hooks": "查看 Hook",
  "Connect through your own backend.": "通过你自己的后端连接。",
  "Supply a client that forwards through your authenticated application backend. This keeps project credentials and tenant authorization on your server while your browser receives only responses that your application has authorized.": "请提供一个通过已验证应用后端转发请求的客户端。这样项目凭证和租户授权将保留在服务器端，浏览器只会收到应用已授权的响应。",
  "The provider receives callable methods and has no API key prop.": "Provider 接收可调用的方法，不接受 API 密钥属性。",
  "The provider takes an interface, not a credential. Put official SDK calls behind your application’s authenticated server route or server action.": "Provider 接收接口，而非凭证。请在应用经过身份验证的服务器路由或 Server Action 中调用官方 SDK。",
  "Use the official API key only in trusted server-side configuration.": "仅在可信的服务器端配置中使用官方 API 密钥。",
  "Authorize the user and tenant before forwarding a request to Tidelight.": "将请求转发至 Tidelight 前，请先验证用户身份及租户权限。",
  "Do not place API keys in client-side React code.": "请勿在客户端 React 代码中放置 API 密钥。",
  "Keys never belong in a browser bundle.": "浏览器打包文件中不得包含密钥。",
  "Small, explicit state surfaces.": "精简、明确的状态界面。",
  "Load supported instruments with an abort signal, stale-request cancellation, error details, and refresh action.": "加载受支持的交易工具，并提供中止信号、取消过期请求、错误详情和刷新操作。",
  "Read research job state; polling is opt-in and ends on a terminal state.": "读取研究任务状态；轮询默认关闭，启用后会在任务进入终态时停止。",
  "Start a durable research job with a generated or caller-supplied idempotency key, then cancel the returned job.": "使用自动生成或调用方提供的幂等键启动持久研究任务，并可取消返回的任务。",
  "Access the provider’s typed client and receive a clear error when used outside the provider.": "访问 Provider 提供的类型化客户端；在 Provider 外调用时会收到明确错误。",
  "Honest states, source-backed cards.": "状态如实呈现，卡片均有来源依据。",
  "renders returned instrument metadata, an accessible busy state, an actionable error state, and a real empty result. It does not generate sample prices or imply that tokenized equity spot products are direct stock shares.": "展示返回的交易工具元数据，并提供易访问的忙碌状态、可执行操作的错误状态和真实空结果。它不会生成示例价格，也不会暗示代币化股票现货产品等同于直接持有的股票。",
  "Accessible skeletons": "易访问的骨架屏",
  "Alert with retry option": "可重试的错误提示",
  "Returned zero results": "返回结果为零",
  "Optional CSS custom properties": "可选 CSS 自定义属性",
  "The UI displays server-returned source labels and never invents data.": "界面展示服务端返回的数据来源标签，不会编造数据。",
  "The package does not implement user authentication or replace Tidelight’s server-side project authorization.": "此软件包不负责用户身份验证，也不会取代 Tidelight 的服务器端项目授权。",
  "in the example is your application’s implementation of the small client interface. It should authenticate the signed-in user, call the official SDK from server-only code, enforce project and tenant access, and return contract-shaped responses. The package test suite verifies the hooks against injected client methods, not against fabricated live market results.": "是你的应用对轻量客户端接口的实现。它应验证已登录用户身份、仅在服务器端代码中调用官方 SDK、强制执行项目和租户访问控制，并返回符合契约的响应。软件包测试套件使用注入的客户端方法验证 Hook，不会将编造的行情结果当作实时结果。",
