  "These terms describe what Tidelight offers": "这些条款说明 Tidelight 提供的服务",
  "Anyone with the link can view the symbol, rule, date window, reported metrics, candle archive, and assumptions. Public for 30 days; account and portfolio details are excluded.": "任何持有此链接的人都可以查看交易代码、规则、日期范围、报告指标、K 线归档和假设。内容公开 30 天；账户和投资组合详情不会披露。",
  ", and/or": "，和/或",
  "), and expire on the date selected at creation. Production and test keys currently access the same live read only market source; the environment label helps you separate applications. Keys can be rotated in the console; rotation immediately revokes the old secret and preserves its scopes, quotas, and expiry. The replacement secret is shown once. Revocation takes effect on the next request. The Security log records key creation, rotation, and revocation with actor and project details, and can be filtered by event type.": "），并在创建时选择的日期到期。生产密钥和测试密钥目前访问同一实时只读行情来源；环境标签便于区分不同应用。可在控制台轮换密钥；轮换会立即撤销旧密钥，并保留其权限范围、配额和到期时间。替换密钥只显示一次。撤销会在下一次请求时生效。安全日志会记录密钥的创建、轮换和撤销，以及操作者和项目详情，并可按事件类型筛选。",
  ". Configure destinations in the developer console. Destinations must use public HTTPS on port 443; private, local, reserved, redirecting, and query-string destinations are rejected. Signing secrets are shown once and encrypted at rest. Rotate a secret if it is lost or exposed.": "。请在开发者控制台配置目标地址。目标地址必须使用 443 端口上的公共 HTTPS；私有、本地、保留、会重定向或包含查询字符串的地址都会被拒绝。签名密钥只显示一次，并在静态存储时加密。如密钥丢失或泄露，请立即轮换。",
  ". Only tools permitted by the selected credential and OAuth grant scopes are listed. Research returns structured snapshots and understandable status; private model reasoning is not exposed. OAuth authorization uses dynamic public client registration, S256 PKCE, explicit signed-in consent, short-lived access tokens, rotating refresh tokens, resource-bound audience checks, and revocation in the developer console. Authorization Server Metadata:": "。仅列出所选凭证和 OAuth 授权范围允许使用的工具。研究结果以结构化快照和清晰状态呈现；不会公开模型的私有推理过程。OAuth 授权使用动态公共客户端注册、S256 PKCE、登录后明确同意、短期访问令牌、轮换式刷新令牌、资源受众校验，并可在开发者控制台撤销。授权服务器元数据：",
  ". Prompts, additional MCP resources, and live trading tools are not enabled.": "。目前未启用提示模板、其他 MCP 资源或实盘交易工具。",
  ". Send an active API key in the": "。请在以下位置发送有效 API 密钥：",
  ". The TypeScript package is published as `@tidelight/sdk` and the Python package as `tidelight`; install commands and current versions are shown in the package directory.": "。TypeScript 软件包以 `@tidelight/sdk` 发布，Python 软件包以 `tidelight` 发布；安装命令和当前版本见软件包目录。",
  ". They provide pagination, typed instruments, bounded retries, timeouts, and research job start, status, cancellation, and bounded polling, webhook endpoint management, and delivery history. The machine-readable OpenAPI 3.1 contract is available in the": "。它们提供分页、类型化交易工具、有界重试、超时，以及研究任务的启动、状态查询、取消和有界轮询、Webhook 端点管理与投递历史。机器可读的 OpenAPI 3.1 契约见",
  "1 to 100, default 20.": "1 至 100，默认值为 20。",
  "; Protected Resource Metadata:": "；受保护资源元数据：",
  "; verify HMAC-SHA256 over": "；请对以下内容执行 HMAC-SHA256 验证：",
  "A successful new request returns": "新请求成功后会返回",
  "Available tools are": "可用工具包括",
