  "Errors use": "错误响应格式为",
  "In the console, select an active project credential and run the instrument request. The explorer applies that key’s scope and quota, records a real request, and shows the response, request ID, time, and copyable code. Its server retrieves only the stored key hash after verifying your signed in account; the secret is never sent back to the browser.": "在控制台中选择一个有效的项目凭证并运行交易工具请求。API 浏览器会应用该密钥的权限范围和配额，记录真实请求，并显示响应、请求 ID、时间和可复制代码。验证你的登录账户后，服务器只会读取已存储的密钥哈希；密钥本身不会返回浏览器。",
  "Keys need the": "密钥需要包含",
  "Meaning": "含义",
