  "Send the secret as a Bearer token over HTTPS. Keys are hashed at rest, scoped to the permissions selected at creation (": "通过 HTTPS 将密钥作为 Bearer 令牌发送。密钥以哈希形式存储，并限定为创建时选择的权限范围（",
